  "title": "Regular -er Verbs",
  "prerequisiteIds": ["fr-lesson-numbers"],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Most French verbs ending in **-er** (like *parler*, *travailler*, *étudier*, *manger*) follow a regular pattern:\n\nje **-e** · tu **-es** · il/elle **-e** · nous **-ons** · vous **-ez** · ils/elles **-ent**\n\ne.g. *parler* → parl**e**, parl**es**, parl**e**, parl**ons**, parl**ez**, parl**ent**." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "fr-ex-er-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "fr-ex-er-2" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "fr-ex-er-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "fr-ex-er-4" }
  ],
  "exercises": [
